# Class-4 Tactical Cube's Station: tapping another creature you control puts charge counters equal to its power on it
# (CR 702.184a). The two 1/1 Borg tokens are 2/2 under the Cube's own pump, so each gives two counters (4); Grizzly Bears,
# which is not an artifact, gives two more (6); the 1/1 Llanowar Elves gives one (7). At 6 it is not a creature; at exactly
# 7 it is an artifact creature with base 4/4, flying, and its own +1/+1, so 5/5 (CR 721.2a-b, 613.1f, 613.4c).

